{"id":"1d831a9b19228b41","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-gamma0-closure.md","title":"Γ₀ 的序数运算闭包","display":"thm-gamma0-closure — Γ₀ 的序数运算闭包","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-gamma0-closure","aliases":["18-thm-gamma0-closure"],"display":"thm-gamma0-closure — Γ₀ 的序数运算闭包","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Derived from §§3.3–3.4 and Lemma 3.4.13","source_pages":"29–33, 39","source_pdf_pages":"39–43, 49","verification_status":"proved-in-note","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-gamma0-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-gamma0-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gamma0-closure — Γ₀ 的序数运算闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3df370596a981512\" href=\"?note=3df370596a981512\" title=\"18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Derived from §§3.3–3.4 and Lemma 3.4.13"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"29–33, 39"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39–43, 49"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；序数加、乘、幂见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3df370596a981512\" href=\"?note=3df370596a981512\" title=\"18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\alpha+\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\land\\alpha\\cdot\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\land\n\\omega^\\alpha&lt;\\Gamma_0\\land\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)&lt;\\Gamma_0\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\alpha+\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\land\\alpha\\cdot\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\land\n\\omega^\\alpha&lt;\\Gamma_0\\land\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)&lt;\\Gamma_0\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Veblen 闭包由 Lemma 3.4.13 给出，取指标 0 即得 ω 幂闭包。取 Γ₀ 下序数的有限 Cantor 标准形：每个和与积的指数仅由较小指数的有限和得到；Γ₀ 为 ε 数，因此先由 Γ₀ 的加法不可分性得到这些指数仍小于 Γ₀，再由 ω 幂及有限和闭包得到乘积小于 Γ₀。空和与零乘积均为 0。所用 Cantor 分解、主序数加法闭包见 §§3.3–3.4；没有把原书未逐项列出的乘法闭包伪称同号定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal-addition","status":"resolved","id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"3df370596a981512"